---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
const schema = [];
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Word Hunt Solver"
  description="What wordhuntsolvers.com collects, how Google Analytics and cookies are used, and the choices you have, including the cookie banner for UK and EU visitors."
  path="/privacy-policy"
  schema={schema}
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 pb-14 pt-6 sm:px-6 sm:pt-10">
    <header id="top" class="scroll-mt-24">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold leading-[1.15] text-headline dark:text-headline-dark sm:text-4xl lg:text-[2.75rem]">Privacy Policy</h1>
<p class="mt-3 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">Last updated: October 8, 2026</p>
    </header>
    <p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">This page explains what information wordhuntsolvers.com collects, why, and the choices you have. Word Hunt Solver is an independent site with no connection to GamePigeon or Apple.</p>
<section id="what-stays-on-your-device" class="scroll-mt-24 py-7 sm:py-9">
<div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="section-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 16v-4M12 8h.01"/></svg></span><h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold leading-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-[1.75rem] dark:text-white">What Stays on Your Device</h2></div>
<p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">The letters you type into the solver, any screenshot you upload, and every board the Board Evolver builds are processed in your browser. They are never sent to our server. To make this work, your browser downloads our word list from our site.</p>
</section>
<section id="information-we-collect" class="scroll-mt-24 py-7 sm:py-9">
<div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="section-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 16v-4M12 8h.01"/></svg></span><h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold leading-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-[1.75rem] dark:text-white">Information We Collect</h2></div>
<div class="mt-4 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
<div class="card !p-5"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold leading-snug text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Analytics</h3>
<p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">We use Google Analytics 4 to understand how people use the site. When analytics is allowed, it records things like the pages you visit, how long you stay, the type of device and browser you use, your general location (such as country or city), and how you found us, such as a search engine or an AI assistant. Google Analytics 4 does not log or store IP addresses. We use this information only in combined reports. It does not include the letters you type or the screenshots you upload.</p></div>
<div class="card !p-5"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold leading-snug text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Contact Form</h3>
<p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">If you send us a message, we receive the name, email address, and message you enter. The form is delivered through Web3Forms, a form service that passes your message to our email inbox.</p></div>
<div class="card !p-5"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold leading-snug text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Server Logs</h3>
<p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">Like most websites, our hosting provider, Hostinger, may automatically record basic technical details when you visit, such as your IP address, browser type, and the time of your visit. These logs help keep the site secure and working.</p></div>
</div>
</section>
<section id="cookies-and-browser-storage" class="scroll-mt-24 py-7 sm:py-9">
<div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="section-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg></span><h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold leading-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-[1.75rem] dark:text-white">Cookies and Browser Storage</h2></div>
<div class="mt-4 overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-brand-100 shadow-sm dark:border-brand-700"><table class="w-full text-sm"><thead class="bg-accent-500 text-brand-700 dark:bg-accent-600"><tr><th scope="col" class="px-4 py-3 text-left font-semibold">Name</th><th scope="col" class="px-4 py-3 text-left font-semibold">Set by</th><th scope="col" class="px-4 py-3 text-left font-semibold">Purpose</th><th scope="col" class="px-4 py-3 text-left font-semibold">How long it lasts</th></tr></thead><tbody class="divide-y divide-brand-100 dark:divide-brand-700"><tr class="odd:bg-white even:bg-brand-50/40 dark:odd:bg-brand-900 dark:even:bg-brand-800"><td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">_ga</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">Google Analytics</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">Tells one visitor apart from another</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">2 years</td></tr><tr class="odd:bg-white even:bg-brand-50/40 dark:odd:bg-brand-900 dark:even:bg-brand-800"><td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">_ga_&lt;container ID&gt;</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">Google Analytics</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">Keeps track of your visit session</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">2 years</td></tr><tr class="odd:bg-white even:bg-brand-50/40 dark:odd:bg-brand-900 dark:even:bg-brand-800"><td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">wh_consent (browser storage)</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">This site</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">Remembers your cookie choice (UK, EEA, and Switzerland)</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">Until you clear it</td></tr><tr class="odd:bg-white even:bg-brand-50/40 dark:odd:bg-brand-900 dark:even:bg-brand-800"><td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">theme (browser storage)</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">This site</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">Remembers light or dark mode</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">Until you clear it</td></tr><tr class="odd:bg-white even:bg-brand-50/40 dark:odd:bg-brand-900 dark:even:bg-brand-800"><td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">wh_last_board (browser storage)</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">This site</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">Remembers the last board you entered in the solver</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">Until you tap Clear or clear your browser data</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">The Google Analytics cookies are only set if analytics is allowed. In the UK, EEA, and Switzerland, that means only after you choose Accept. The three browser storage items stay on your device and are not sent to us.</p>
</section>
<section id="your-cookie-choices" class="scroll-mt-24 py-7 sm:py-9">
<div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="section-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg></span><h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold leading-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-[1.75rem] dark:text-white">Your Cookie Choices</h2></div>
<p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">If you visit from the UK, the European Economic Area, or Switzerland, a banner asks whether you accept analytics cookies. Google Analytics stays off unless you choose Accept, and choosing Reject keeps it off. You can change your choice at any time with the Cookie Settings link at the bottom of every page. Visitors from other regions do not see the banner, and analytics runs by default. You can also block or delete cookies in your browser settings, or install Google's <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" class="font-semibold text-headline underline-offset-2 hover:underline dark:text-headline-dark" rel="noopener" target="_blank">opt out add on</a>.</p>
</section>
<section id="how-we-use-information" class="scroll-mt-24 py-7 sm:py-9">
<div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="section-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 16v-4M12 8h.01"/></svg></span><h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold leading-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-[1.75rem] dark:text-white">How We Use Information</h2></div>
<p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">We use analytics to see which pages help people, find problems, and improve the tools. We use contact messages only to reply to you. We do not sell your personal information, and we do not show ads.</p>
</section>
<section id="who-we-share-information-with" class="scroll-mt-24 py-7 sm:py-9">
<div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="section-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 16v-4M12 8h.01"/></svg></span><h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold leading-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-[1.75rem] dark:text-white">Who We Share Information With</h2></div>
<p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">We share information only with the services that run the site: Google (analytics), Web3Forms (contact form), and Hostinger (hosting). We may also share information if the law requires it. Google explains its <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" class="font-semibold text-headline underline-offset-2 hover:underline dark:text-headline-dark" rel="noopener" target="_blank">data use practices</a> for sites like ours.</p>
</section>
<section id="how-long-we-keep-information" class="scroll-mt-24 py-7 sm:py-9">
<div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="section-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 16v-4M12 8h.01"/></svg></span><h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold leading-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-[1.75rem] dark:text-white">How Long We Keep Information</h2></div>
<p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">Google Analytics keeps event data for the retention period set in our account, which is either 2 or 14 months. Contact messages are kept only as long as needed to answer them.</p>
</section>
<section id="legal-basis-for-visitors-in-the-uk-and-eea" class="scroll-mt-24 py-7 sm:py-9">
<div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="section-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 16v-4M12 8h.01"/></svg></span><h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold leading-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-[1.75rem] dark:text-white">Legal Basis for Visitors in the UK and EEA</h2></div>
<p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">We use analytics cookies only with your consent. We process contact messages to answer your request, and server logs for our legitimate interest in keeping the site secure.</p>
</section>
<section id="your-rights" class="scroll-mt-24 py-7 sm:py-9">
<div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="section-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg></span><h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold leading-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-[1.75rem] dark:text-white">Your Rights</h2></div>
<p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">Depending on where you live, you may have the right to ask what personal information we hold about you, to correct it, to delete it, or to object to how we use it. If you are in the UK, you can also complain to the <a href="https://ico.org.uk" class="font-semibold text-headline underline-offset-2 hover:underline dark:text-headline-dark" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Information Commissioner's Office</a>. To make a request, use our contact page.</p>
</section>
<section id="childrens-privacy" class="scroll-mt-24 py-7 sm:py-9">
<div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="section-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg></span><h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold leading-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-[1.75rem] dark:text-white">Children's Privacy</h2></div>
<p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">This site is not directed at children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from them. If you believe a child under 13 has sent us personal information through our contact form, contact us and we will delete it.</p>
</section>
<section id="changes-to-this-policy" class="scroll-mt-24 py-7 sm:py-9">
<div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="section-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 16v-4M12 8h.01"/></svg></span><h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold leading-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-[1.75rem] dark:text-white">Changes to This Policy</h2></div>
<p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">If we change how the site handles information, we will update this page and the date at the top.</p>
</section>
<section id="contact-us" class="scroll-mt-24 py-7 sm:py-9">
<div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="section-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5"><rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="m22 7-10 6L2 7"/></svg></span><h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold leading-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-[1.75rem] dark:text-white">Contact Us</h2></div>
<p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">Questions about this policy? Reach us through our <a href="/contact" class="font-semibold text-headline underline-offset-2 hover:underline dark:text-headline-dark">contact page</a>.</p>
</section>
  </article>
</Layout>
